// Task - PvP_WB_Villain_Patrol1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P348728018" "<color red>This mission takes place in the PvP zone of Warburg. You may encounter other hostile players during the course of this mission.</color> <br><br>If you're going to battling the heroes in warburg, Arachnos has decreed that you should know the battlefield. We have set up a series of waypoints near locations of interest, and suggest that you trace the route to get the lay of the land. We'll send you to look at 5 of them."
// AcceptString :
"P3300554970" "Patrol 5 waypoints in Warburg"
// SendOffString :
"P2121173239" "We've set your waypoints. Stay Alert, and learn the terrain of the island. <br><br>You may see Vigilantes from Paragon City out there. You don't have to engage them to finish the mission, but that is rather missing the point of this zone. This is an open battle area, so you can fight them if you want to. And remember that they may want to bring you to justice just as badly. <br><br>Don't get yourself killed out there. I don't want to fill out the paperwork."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3582135062" "Go to the indicated waypoint"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3249366403" "This shouldn't be too difficult for you. Remember that you're just getting the lay of the land on this. If you want to try to avoid battle, that's not my concern, but that's really missing the point."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P826145997" "You completed your patrol route."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3375633898" "That shouldn't have been too tough for you. Warburg may not be the biggest island, but it's important to know your way around. You might want to explore some more on your own."
// RandomFameString :
"P3930047472" "I hear {VillainName} was casing out Warburg."

