// IntroString :
"P283431732" "<color red>This mission takes place in the PvP zone of Warburg. You may encounter other hostile players during the course of this mission.</color> <br><br>The heroes of Paragon city are encroaching on us out here, citing weapons-proliferations violations, and other such rubbish. To help contain their investigations, we have been authorized to send 'security contractors' such as yourself to patrol the island."
// AcceptString :
"P2992587239" "Patrol 6 waypoints in Warburg"
// SendOffString :
"P1249382195" "We've set your waypoints. Learn the terrain and you might survive. <br><br>A large part of the battle between heroes and villains is concentrated around these rocket sites, so you may see Vigilanties from Paragon City out there. You don't have to engage them to finish the mission, but that is rather missing the point of this zone. This is an open battle area, so you can battle them if chose. And remember that some Heroes want nothing more than to bring you to justice, and may decide to start a fight on their own."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P244116256" "This shouldn't be too difficult for you. Remember that you're just getting the lay of the land on this. If you want to try to avoid battle, that's not my concern, but it does seem like rather a waste of time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4158186194" "You may have seen the Warburg Rocket while travelling through the zone. Launching that Rocket can get you an edge against your enemies, even in base raids. It's a valuable resource, and don't think the heroes aren't aware of that."

