// IntroString :
"P762383951" "<color red>This mission takes place in the PvP zone of Warburg. You may encounter other hostile players during the course of this mission.</color> <br><br>We must show our power in Warburg to keep the heroes off our backs. To that end, we've set a patrol route through Warburg, and are on the lookout for villains to run it."
// SendOffString :
"P1236762879" "We've set your waypoints. The Web can be a dangerous place, so keep your head. <br><br>You may see Paragon City heroes out there. You don't have to engage them to finish the patrol, but that is rather missing the point of this zone. This is an open battle area, so you can engage in fights with them if you want to. And remember that some heroes will want nothing better than to bring you to justice."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P889861746" "This shouldn't be too difficult for you. Remember that if you want to try to avoid battle, that's not my concern, though it does seem like a waste of time."

