// IntroString :
"P2548061234" "<color red>This mission takes place in the PvP zone of Warburg. You may encounter other hostile players during the course of this mission.</color> <br><br>The battle for Warburg never ends. Our hated opposites in Longbow are attempting to set up a forward command base. I want you to take out the base's occupants and blow it up. We'll even provide the bombs. If the base is destroyed, it should hinder the heroes in the Warburg, reducing the damage output of all heroes in this zone by 1%. I know it doesn't sound like much, but it adds up, and counter-balances hero efforts to enhance themselves. This has to be done quickly, you'll only have 60 minutes"
// AcceptString :
"P3406981565" "Plant bombs to decrease all Heroes' Damage"
// SendOffString :
"P3391147411" "Defeat the Longbow agents in the base and plant those bombs. I'd recommend that you hurry!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3660325663" "Defeat all Longbow in base"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P357850462" "You need to plant 4 bombs and defeat the agents here. Time is running out!"

