"P2089649468" "<color red>This mission takes place in the PvP zone of Warburg. You may encounter other hostile players during the course of this mission.</color> <br><br>We have an opportunity to kidnap a Longbow Communications officer. Doing so will keep the heroes from knowing what we're up to, and effectively decrease the damage resistance of all heroes in Warburg by 1%. It may not sound like a lot, but it can add up, and also offsets the Heroes' attempts to increase their power Warburg. <br><br>There isn't much time for this operation. You'll only have 60 minutes to capture the communications officer and get out."
// AcceptString :
"P1018488688" "Kidnapped Longbow Communications Officer"
// SendOffString :
"P1301807439" "You have 60 minutes to catch here, get her out, and defeat the other Longbow in the base. Good hunting!"
