"P2826976067" "<color red>This mission takes place in the PvP zone of Warburg. You may encounter other hostile players during the course of this mission.</color> <br><br>We've discovered a Longbow supply warehouse full of equipment. We want to deprive them of it, and take for our own. To this end, we would like you to remove the Longbow squad currently guarding it. This equipment can then be used to increase the damage of all villains in the zone by 1%. It adds up, and helps to counter hero attempt to undermine us. The time-frame on this is limited, so you'll only have 60 minutes to finish."
// AcceptString :
"P2590144651" "Defeat all Longbow guards in supply warehouse within 60 minutes"
// SendOffString :
"P1137713837" "Defeat them all and drive them out of the warehouse. You have 60 minutes. Go."
